   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SABESP: Accelerating Universal Sanitation In S&#xe3;o Paulo With  Brazil&#x2019;s First Blue A/B Structure</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project consists of a senior unsecured corporate loan to Companhia de Saneamento B&#xe1;sico do Estado de S&#xe3;o Paulo (&#x201c;SABESP&#x201d;) to fund investments needed to support the company to achieve the sewage universalization goals, expanding sewage collection, and treatment services from 85%to 99% of the population in the State of S&#xe3;o Paulo, Brazil.The loan will be labeled Blue for its investments in sustainable wastewater management and pollution prevention, listed as eligible blue project categories.</narrative>
  </description>
